{
  "name": "dsh-bili-study",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "学习台 · DeepSeek Harness 面板插件：聚合 B 站学习视频，按目录专注学习、记笔记并导出、AI 快速查概念、学习奖励机制。",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
